    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Proof. Let x∗ be a weak efficient solution solution for OWCP(U). It must be shown that 0 ∈ Conv∪j∈Λ∂Hj(x∗). Since given function hj(x,ξi) is continuously differentiable and convex for each j and ξi ∈ U, then hj(x,ξi) will be locally Lipschitz continuous for all i ∈ Λ¯ . Then 0 ∈ Conv{∪j∈Λ∂Hj(x∗)} (see Theorem 4.3 in [71] ). Conversely, by assumption 0 ∈ Conv{∪j∈Λ∂Hj(x∗)} it is clear that x∗ is Pareto critical point. Then for atleast one j0, it is established that H′"
